SDUSD::convertToAssets
├── when total supply and total assets are zero
│   └── it should convert shares to assets at the initial ratio
├── when the vault has existing supply
│   ├── it should use SDUSD totalAssets and total supply
│   └── it should round the converted asset amount down
├── when a reward period is active
│   └── it should value shares using only currently unlocked assets
├── when the reward period has finished
│   └── it should value shares using all accounted rewards
└── when the vault has received a raw DUSD donation
    └── it should ignore the donation in the conversion
